# 🔠 Lumiseq Typography System

**Style Direction: Innovative + Forward**

Primary Display Font → **Space Grotesk**
Body & UI Font → **Inter**

---

## 1. Font Usage Rules

Space Grotesk → Headlines only
Inter → Body, UI text, navigation, forms

Never use Space Grotesk for long paragraphs.
Never use more than these two fonts.

Hierarchy creates authority.

---

